      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Why workqueues exist",
      "source_hash": 3628638689681904239,
      "context_hash": 3675119576816469039,
      "translation": "workqueue가 존재하는 이유",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "workqueues": "workqueue"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:40.756147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Interrupt handlers (hardirq and softirq) run atomically — they cannot sleep or block.",
      "source_hash": 602462494574408420,
      "context_hash": 4419352590746439080,
      "translation": "인터럽트 핸들러(hardirq와 softirq)는 원자적으로 실행되므로 sleep하거나 블록될 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interrupt handlers": "인터럽트 핸들러",
        "softirq": "softirq"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:40.756147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Work that needs to sleep, acquire mutexes, or do I/O must be deferred.",
      "source_hash": 10910267414251255257,
      "context_hash": 8521759125461007139,
      "translation": "sleep하거나, 뮤텍스를 획득하거나, I/O를 수행해야 하는 작업은 지연시켜야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "mutexes": "뮤텍스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:40.756147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Workqueues provide a kernel thread pool that can run this deferred work in process context.",
      "source_hash": 7490632411966052617,
      "context_hash": 14417287565793028367,
      "translation": "workqueue는 이렇게 지연된 작업을 프로세스 컨텍스트에서 실행할 수 있는 커널 스레드 풀을 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel thread": "커널 스레드",
        "pool": "풀",
        "process": "프로세스",
        "workqueues": "workqueue"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:40.756147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Concurrency-Managed Workqueues (cmwq)",
      "source_hash": 3559197898102673848,
      "context_hash": 12761574868008163218,
      "translation": "Concurrency-Managed Workqueues(cmwq)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "workqueues": "workqueue"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:40.756148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Since Linux 2.6.36, workqueues use **cmwq** — introduced by Tejun Heo [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/394084/) — a unified worker pool that automatically manages concurrency:",
      "source_hash": 16475766776746825872,
      "context_hash": 9166862022670664812,
      "translation": "Linux 2.6.36부터 workqueue는 Tejun Heo가 도입한 **cmwq**[(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/394084/)를 사용합니다. 이는 동시성을 자동으로 관리하는 통합 worker 풀입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "pool": "풀",
        "workqueues": "workqueue"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:27:28.615594Z",
      "issues": []
    },
